title: "fastmaps: composition-plane QC for FASTQ reads"
abstract: "Places every read in a (T+C, T+G) composition plane, per mate: polyA/polyT/polyG/polyC corners and off-composition mass — including the NovaSeq R2 polyG signature — in one image."
